.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1654,"cta":{"id":2439,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Talea_By_Beyond_Dubai_Maritime_City_1_4_BR_Forest_Homes_7082efe3cb.jpg","hash":"Talea_By_Beyond_Dubai_Maritime_City_1_4_BR_Forest_Homes_7082efe3cb","name":"Talea By Beyond Dubai Maritime City | 1-4BR Forest Homes"},"style":null,"title":"Dubai Maritime City: A Dynamic Hub Designed for Business & Lifestyle","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Talea by Beyond in Dubai Maritime City offers an extraordinary blend of breathtaking sea views, urban convenience, and premium waterfront living.</p><p>Set within a master-planned coastal district, Dubai Maritime City is strategically located between Port Rashid and Drydocks World, just minutes from Downtown Dubai, Jumeirah, and Dubai International Airport.</p><ul><li>Mina Rashid – 5 Minutes</li><li>Jumeirah Beach Coast – 10 Minutes</li><li>Burj Khalifa / Downtown Dubai – 15 Minutes</li><li>Dubai Intl. Airport – 20 Minutes</li><li>DIFC – 20 Minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4153,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_6ec854330c.pdf","hash":"brochure_6ec854330c","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":2859,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3904,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Talea_By_Beyond_Dubai_Maritime_City_1_4_BR_Forest_Homes_f8fac284ba.jpg","hash":"Talea_By_Beyond_Dubai_Maritime_City_1_4_BR_Forest_Homes_f8fac284ba","name":"T